### 推导

渐近层密度为：

$$
dN(M)\sim Cd\,M^{d-1}dM.
$$

所以：

$$
\begin{aligned}
\Phi(k^2)
&\sim
Cd
\int_0^\infty
M^{d-1}
\log\left(1+\frac{k^2}{M^2}\right)dM\\
&=
Cd|k|^d
\int_0^\infty
u^{d-1}
\log(1+u^{-2})du.
\end{aligned}
$$

而：

$$
\int_0^\infty
u^{d-1}
\log(1+u^{-2})du
=
\frac{\pi}{d}
\csc\frac{\pi d}{2}.
$$

